n e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel wanda masu tallafi za su iya ba da amsa a kansa.','AI providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis na AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar ChatGPT. Mai ƙwarewa a fannoni da dama.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu kera Claude. Masu ƙwarewa a rubutu da zurfafa tunani cikin natsuwa.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Masu sauri kuma marasa tsada.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai samfuran da ke da sauri kuma marasa tsada.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran masu ƙarancin farashi waɗanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da lissafin lamba.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Mabuɗi ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki a kan kwamfutarka ko uwar garkenka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi idan ba a saita wani abu na musamman ba)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutu da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lambar da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi haƙuri, ba a ba ku izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan ana amfani da su tare ta kowane manhajar plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An ɓoye maɓallanku a cikin rumbun adana bayanai na wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma ana tura su ne kawai ga mai bada sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa — ba a taɓa tura mana ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 cikin 2: zaɓi mai bada sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo mabuɗinku na kanku, don haka kuna biyan mai bada sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuke amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbaci? Kowanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki da kyau; kuna iya ƙara wasu daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 cikin 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku mai dacewa da OpenAI, wanda ke ƙarewa da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Bude %s kuma shiga (ko ƙirƙiri asusun kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon mabuɗi kuma kwafa shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Manna shi a ƙasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye kuma gwada". Muna aika ƙaramar buƙata guda ɗaya don duba ko yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Mafi yawan masu ba da sabis suna buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'Ƙara kuɗi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zaɓi wani mai bada sabis na daban','Address'=>'Adireshi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Mabuɗin da aka ajiye yana ƙarewa da …%s — manna sabo don maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Mabuɗi (na zaɓi)','API key'=>'Makullin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma gwada','Providers'=>'Masu samarwa','Provider'=>'Mai bada sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Mabuɗi','Get a key'=>'Sami maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Sabuwar sigar manhaja ce ta adana: sabunta wannan manhaja, ko kuma sake shigar da maɓallin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya sake buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba (maɓallan tsaron rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — an ci jarrabawar ƙarshe %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin ƙarshe ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wanne samfuri za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ yana nuna shawararmu don wannan aiki. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da mabuɗinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfura daga masu bada sabis','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini domin ƙirƙirar hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na mai ba da sabis na farko da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafi (embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina fihirisar bincike ta rukunin yanar gizonku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farkon mai bada sabis da aka haɗa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Sauya wannan yana sake gina ma\'anar bincike na kowane toshe mai amfani da shi.','best quality'=>'Mafi kyawun inganci','lowest cost'=>'Mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'Mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfur da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Wani samfuri ya fito yau? Manna ainihin sunansa don amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfuri','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfuri','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawara','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tantance jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna wata shawara ba. Sake shigar da manhajar (plugin), ko kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a kasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'An buga jerin da ake amfani da su a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar manhaja yana kawo sabo.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Kuma duba Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don sabon jerin.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kawai buƙatar saukewa mai sauƙi ake aikawa: babu kowane maɓalli, babu adireshin shafi, babu wani abu game da abubuwan da ke cikinku. An sanya wa lissafin hannu, kuma ana watsi da lissafin da bai ci jarrabawar sa hannu ba.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An duba na ƙarshe %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan duba yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'An shigar da sabon jeri','already up to date'=>'ya riga ya kasance na zamani','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'Zazzagewar ta gaza wajen tantance sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da ita','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® ba; jerin da ake amfani da su a yanzu za su ci gaba da aiki','turned off'=>'a kashe','Open'=>'Bude','Check their status page'=>'Duba shafin matsayinsu','Open your billing page'=>'Bude shafin biyan kuɗin ku','Open your API keys page'=>'Bude shafin makullin API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Bude saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi haƙuri, ba a ba ku izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mai ba da sabis da ba a sani ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafar shi, ba tare da tazarori ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Fara liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An ajiye samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar da ainihin sunan samfurin, misali kamar yadda yake a rubuce a cikin takaddun mai bayarwa.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An ƙara %s. Zaɓi shi a ƙarƙashin "Wane samfur za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa na yau da kullum. Ana amfani da jeri wanda ya zo tare da manhajar.','Checked: %s.'=>'An duba: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfura.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon juzu\'i na ɗaya daga cikin kayan aikin ku (plugins) ya ajiye maɓallin AI ɗin ku. Sabunta wannan kayan aiki, ko sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗin ku da aka ajiye ba (maɓallan tsaro na shafin sun canza). Sake shigar da shi a saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara mabuɗi don mai ba da sabis na AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi wani samfuri don wannan aiki ba. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai bada sabis na AI ba shi da goyon baya a wannan sigar ta toshe.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu mai bada sabis na AI da aka haɗa wanda zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna. Ƙara maɓallin OpenAI ko Google Gemini a saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna ba. Zaɓi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Makullin AI na ku ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin hoto ba. Bincika izinin makullin tare da mai bada sabis, ko zaɓi wani mai bada sabis daban don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu mai samar da AI da aka haɗa da zai iya gina ma\'anar bincike. Ƙara mabuɗin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Mabuɗin AI ɗinka ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin sakawa (embedding) ba. Bincika izinin mabuɗin tare da mai bayarwa, ko zaɓi wani mai bayarwa na daban don binciken shafin.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai samar da AI ba zai iya gina ma\'anar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis mai dacewa don binciken shafi.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin ya kasa samun sabis ɗin AI ɗinka. Duba don tabbatar da cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya samun adireshinsa daga uwar garken gidan yanar gizonka (ba za a iya samun sabis ɗin da ke kan kwamfutarka daga shafin da aka karɓi bakunci ba).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kasa isa ga %s. Duba shafin matsayinsu; idan yana aiki, mai masaukin ku na iya toshe hanyoyin haɗin da ke fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai ba ne.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da sauran kiredit ko rabo. Ƙara kiredit ko ɗaga iyakarka a cikin asusunka da su, sannan sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallinku ba. Wataƙila an yi kuskuren rubuta shi, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma manna shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ƙi amincewa da wannan buƙatar don maɓallinku. Wataƙila maɓallin ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunku yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Samfurin "%1$s" ba ya samuwa daga %2$s don makullin ku. Zaɓi wani samfurin a saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarinku na %2$s ba ya haɗa da samfurin "%1$s". Zaɓi wani samfurin a saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarinku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s yana iyakance saurin da mabuɗinku zai iya aika buƙatu. Jira na minti ɗaya sannan ku sake gwadawa, ko ƙara ƙa\'idar adadin ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsala a halin yanzu (katsewar aiki ko yawan cunkoso daga bangarensu). Babu matsala a saitunanku. Sake gwadawa an jima kadan.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Bukatar AI ta gaza saboda dalilin da ba mu iya gano shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashin tallafi tare da cikakkun bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya bayar da amsa a tsarin da wannan manhaja ba za ta iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin na daban ko tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na musamman (mai dacewa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye mabuɗi don wannan mai bada sabis da farko.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Makullin ku yana aiki, amma mai bada sabis bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu don shi ba. Ƙara samfurin da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya ba da amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinku a shirye suke don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Matsayin mai amfani naka ba a ba shi izinin amfani da AI a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kai iyakar kashe kudin AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya kara shi a saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kai iyakar buƙatun AI na kowane wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da farashi','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rajista, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki ne akan AI da aka yi amfani da shi ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudaden kimantawa ne, an samo su ne daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da ba a san farashinsa ba ana lissafa shi a matsayin sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan watan: buƙatu %1$s, kusan %2$s.','When'=>'Yaushe','Who'=>'Wane ne','Used for'=>'Ana amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfuri','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamomin shiga / fita','About'=>'Game da','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a riga an yi buƙatun AI ba tukuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kudi ta wata (dala na US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi a wofi idan ba ka son iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kiyasin kuɗin ya kai wannan matakin.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakar buƙatun wata-wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi a wofi don ba tare da iyaka ba.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Kada ka zaɓi ko ɗaya domin barin duk wanda zai iya amfani da fasalolin manhajar ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa na iya amfani da shi a koyaushe.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An ajiye iyaka da izini.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Wannan yaren ba ɗaya daga cikin yarukan wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba ne.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Fassara dole ne ta kasance irin abun ciki ɗaya da na asali.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin sauran harsunan rukunin yanar gizon.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Rubutun allon sarrafawa sun ɓace daga wannan kofi na manhajar. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Zaɓi harshe','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Abokin ciniki na hosting? Samu rangwamen %1$d%% a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayin abokin cinikin karɓar baƙuncin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®, za ku sami lambar sirri ta rangwamen %d%% a kan biyan kuɗinku na farko. Sabuntawa yana kan farashin yau da kullun.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Sami lambar %d%% tawa kuma je wurin biya','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne masu tsarin ɗaukar nauyin shafi (hosting) na biya da ke cikin kyakkyawan yanayi. Gwajin kyauta ba ya ciki.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin ciniki na bakuncin don wannan toshe.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku ba a yanzu. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne dafa-gaba ya ƙunshi ƙananan haruffa ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, ya fara da harafi, kuma kada ya sanya sunan toshe.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" ba lambar yare ba ce. Yi amfani da yaren WordPress kamar fr_FR ko de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Jera aƙalla harshe ɗaya.','Translations'=>'Fassarori','Edit the %s version'=>'Gyara sigar %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Kwatanta sigar %s gefe da gefe','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Rubutun madadin','Caption'=>'Kashin bayani','Title'=>'Take','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin menu ɗinku ga kowane harshe.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Ajiye wannan rubutun tukunna, sannan a fassara shi a nan.','This one'=>'Wannan','Edit'=>'Gyara','Side by side'=>'Kusa da juna','Translate again'=>'Sake fassara','Translate'=>'Fassara','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Ƙirƙiri kwafi don fassarawa da hannu','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Fassara tana amfani da injin da aka saita don wannan harshen. Sigar da mutum ya gyara ba a taɓa rubuta wani abu a kai ba.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin fassara wannan abu ba.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: an fassara.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Wannan ba fassara ba ce, saboda haka babu abin da za a kare.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Irin wannan abun ciki ba a fassara shi ba.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Rubutun %s ba ya kan wannan shafin kuma. Sake loda shafin.','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'Babu injin fassara da ya iya karɓar wannan rubutu.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Zabi ɗaya daga cikin sauran yarukanku.','Compare translation'=>'Kwatanta fassara','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan fassarar ba.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Wannan ba fassara ba ce, don haka babu abin da za a kwatanta.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Asalin wannan fassarar ba ya nan kuma.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Sashe %s ba ya cikin wannan fassarar kuma. Sake loda shafin kuma sake gwadawa.','Translate on this page'=>'Fassara a wannan shafi','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Wannan abu yana da wani nau\'i a wannan harshe.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Wannan injin fassara ba ya samuwa a wannan shafi.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injinoni daban-daban ga kowane harshe, madadin kai-tsaye da iyakokin kashe kuɗi siffofi ne na Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Fassarorin da aka fi so da salon magana a kowane harshe fasaloli ne na Tranzly Pro. Jerin abubuwan da ba za a fassara ba kyauta ne.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Ƙimar don %s ba ɗaya daga cikin zaɓuɓɓukan da aka ba da izini ba ne.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Layen bayan fage ba ya samuwa a wannan shafin.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Aikin fassara yana gudana ne a matsayin mutumin da ya fara shi, saboda haka dole ne mai amfani ya shiga ciki.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Babu wani abu da aka ba ku izinin fassarawa a cikin wannan zaɓin.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Wannan abu ba wani ɓangare bane na aikin fassara.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin canza wannan fassarar ba.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Rukunin wannan abu yana da sigar %1$s riga (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Wani abu ba zai iya zama fassarar kansa ba.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Wannan abu ya riga ya zama fassarar wani abu na daban. Cire mahadarsa tukunna.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya ajiye mahaɗin fassarar ba.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara wannan rubutun a nan ba.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara wannan rubutun kafofin watsa labarai a nan ba.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Za a iya buga fassarar ko a ajiye ta a matsayin daftari.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin buga irin wannan abun ciki ba.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'An riga an rubuta wannan abu a wannan yaren.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Wannan fassarar an gyara ta ne ta hanyar mutum (ko kuma an shigo da ita), don haka tana da kariya. Bude ta don sake fassara ta.','That item does not exist.'=>'Wannan abu babu shi.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Ba a saita wata injin fassara ba tukuna. Ƙara mabuɗi don guda ɗaya a Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Ba a riga an saita wannan injin fassarar ba: da farko ka ƙara mabudinsa.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Wani aikin yana fassara wannan rubutun a yanzu; wannan abu zai yi amfani da waccan amsar.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Babu injin fassara da ya iya ɗaukar wannan abu.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injin ɗin bai dawo da fassara ga kowane ɓangare na wannan abu ba. Ba a canza komai ba.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Dole ne kowane yare ya kasance ɗaya daga cikin yarukan rukunin yanar gizon, tare da injin da ake da shi.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Jerin madadin zai iya sanya sunayen injunan da suke akwai kawai.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Iyakar kowane wata wani adadi ne a dalar US, sifili ko fiye, don injin da ke akwai.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Dole ne a tattara abubuwan ƙamus ta ɗaya daga cikin yarukan rukunin yanar gizon.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Ana saita sautin kowane yaren shafi: tsarin ladabi na asali, fiye ko ƙasa da haka, da kuma ƙarin umarni na zaɓi.','AI model'=>'Samfurin AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Samfurin AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsala a halin yanzu. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko amfani da wani injin.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Rukunin yanar gizonku ya kasa isa ga %s. Bincika ko zai iya yin hanyoyin haɗin waje, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin API ɗinku ba. Duba maɓallin a cikin Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Asusunka na %s ya cinye kason sa ko ma\'aunin sa. Sake loda shi tare da su, ko amfani da wani injin.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s ya nemi mu rage gudu. Za a sake gwadawa ta atomatik.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Wannan rubutun ya yi tsawo da yawa ga %s a lokaci guda. Raba abin da ke ciki, ko amfani da wani injin na daban.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s ya ƙi fassara wannan abun ciki. Gwada wani injin ɗin, ko fassara shi da hannu.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s ba ya fassara wannan harshe. Zaɓi wata injin don shi.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'An kai ga iyakar kashe kuɗi na wannan watan na %s, don haka ba a ƙara aika komai zuwa gare shi ba. Ƙara iyakar a Tranzly → Engines, ko jira har zuwa wata mai zuwa.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Fassarar tare da %s ta gaza saboda wani dalili da Tranzly ta kasa ganewa. Cikakkun bayanai suna ƙasa.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dole ne ID ɗin inji ya kasance ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamomin ɗebe.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'mabuɗin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Ba a riga an haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba tukuna, wanda hakan ya zama dole don hana kunna shi ba tare da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da kai, ka yarda ka raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani da WordPress ɗinka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusu','Account Details'=>'Cikakken Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusunku, sannan ku sake tura fom ɗin ɗan haɗin gwiwa.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna son haɗa %1$s zuwa %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunna Sigar Kyauta','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'Kunna lasisi a nan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da makullin lasisin da kuka karɓa a imel nan da nan bayan siye:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a kan duk shafuka a cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar da aka biya ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna ta don fara cin gajiyar fasalolin %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' An riga an shigar da sigar biya ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je zuwa %2$s don kunna ta kuma fara cin gajiyar fasalolin %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunna siffofin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An yi nasarar kunna asusunka tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Yana aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yankin','Add-Ons'=>'Ƙarin Ayyuka','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ƙarin Ayyuka na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu sami damar loda jerin ƙarin kayan aiki (add-ons) ba. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintuna.','Add-On'=>'Kari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s kari ne na musamman na biyan kudi kawai. Dole ne ku fara siyan lasisi kafin kunna manhajar plugin din.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An yi nasarar sayen ƙarin fasalin %s.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An yi nasarar haɓaka tsarin ƙarin %s ɗinku.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An yi nasarar soke gwajin kyauta na %s. Tun da ƙarin na musamman ne kawai an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kuna son amfani da shi a gaba, dole ne ku sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ba zai iya aiki ba tare da toshewar ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai muna sanar da ku cewa ana samo bayanan ƙarin abubuwa na %s daga wata uwar garken waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Kari-karin sashe na %s','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshi %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin Haɗin Gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sakamakon keta ka\'idojin haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar toshe asusun haɗin gwiwarku na ɗan lokaci. Idan kuna da wata tambaya, tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusunka na haɗin gwiwa na ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi takardar neman zama abokin tarayya ta %1$s! Shiga yankin abokin tarayyarku a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Mun gode da kuka nemi shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa (affiliate program), amma abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amincewa da takardarku a wannan lokacin. Da fatan za ku sake gwadawa nan da kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Mun gode da kuka nemi shiga shirinmu na haɗin gwiwa (affiliate program), za mu duba bayananku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntuɓe ku da ƙarin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kuki na bibiya bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Dangantaka','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare har yanzu kuna iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar yin amfani da fasalolin %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare ba za ku ƙara samun damar amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin fasali na musamman.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Kuna iya ci gaba da amfani da dukkan fasalolin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasaloli na %2$s ba, ko kuma tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da haɓakawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan %1$s ɗinku na kyauta, biya ƙasa da %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yarda kuma Kunnawa Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na yarda - Sauya Mai amfani','All Requests'=>'Duk Buƙatun','All Types'=>'Duk Ire-ire','allow'=>'Ba da izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin tsarin bibiyar amfani da sabis ɗinmu, wanda ke taimaka mana wajen ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun amince da bin sawun yadda ake amfani da su, wanda ke taimaka mana wajen ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kowace shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayi maras suna','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Aiwatar a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Aiwatar a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Nemi zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince & Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Da fatan za ku gaya mana dalilin domin mu inganta.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi don haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake aiko muku da maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi lokacin sayayya kuma za mu sake tura muku maɓallin lasisin.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa da asusun mai lasisi.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'ID ɗin manhaja mara inganci.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ku da ingantaccen lasisi don samun damar shiga nau\'in na musamman.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Girkawa ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka amince.','Premium version already active.'=>'Tuni an kunna sigar Premium.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar ƙari mai daraja.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Wannan plugin ɗin "Serviceware" ne, wanda ke nufin ba shi da sigar lambar sirri ta musamman (premium).','Automatic Installation'=>'Girkawa ta atomatik','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashe kansa a:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Kima','Awesome'=>'Mai ban mamaki','based on %s'=>'bisa ga %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kudi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ko kun san cewa %1$s yana da tsarin haɗin gwiwa (affiliate program)? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zai maye gurbin sigar %s da kuka girka da sabuwar sigar Beta da aka fitar - ku yi amfani da shi cikin taka-tsan-tsan, kuma ba a kan rukunin yanar gizo na gaske ba. An yi muku gargaɗi.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An biya %s','Billing'=>'Biyan kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biyan Kuɗi da Rasitoci','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana toshewa','Blog ID'=>'ID na Blog','Body'=>'Gangar jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ee - dukkan adiresoshin nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kunshi','Bundle Plan'=>'Tarin Tsari','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayi lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon daban) - za ka so ka soke %2$s ɗin kuma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai toshe damar yin amfani da duk wasu fasaloli na musamman nan take. Ka tabbata?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke rajista','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun maɓallin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Sauya Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An aike da imel ɗin tabbatarwa zuwa %s yanzu haka. Dole ne ku tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba ku ga imel ɗin ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil ɗin saƙon takarce (spam).','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An aika da imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s yanzu. Dole ne mai imel ɗin ya tabbatar da sabuntawar a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ne sabon mai asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mun gode da tabbatar da sauya mallakar. An aika da imel yanzu zuwa ga %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canza Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Sauya Tsari','Change User'=>'Canza Mai amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar canza mai amfani, kun yarda ku canja ikon mallakar asusun zuwa ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Tarihin Canje-canje','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana sauya mai amfani, da fatan a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ku sami imel ɗin ba, ku gwada duba babban fayil ɗin spam ɗinku ko ku bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya da Fita','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zaɓi har zuwa shafi/shafuka %s domin kunna lasisin a kai.','City'=>'Birni','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ma\'ajiyar API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Bayanan Wucin Gadi na Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da manhajar ba tare da an san ko wanene ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna domin ganin bita-bitai da suka ba da kimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ita ce adireshin imel na abokin cinikina','Code'=>'Lambar sirri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kwamitin %s lokacin da abokin ciniki ya sayi sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka haura kwanaki 30 ne kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Yana dacewa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'Kammala shiga ciki','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Taya murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Kada ku taɓa rasa sabuntawa mai mahimmanci','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Mun gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Zaɓi shiga don samun sanarwar imel game da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayin lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu bayanan asali na yanayin WordPress. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku kuma ya fi yin abin da kuke buƙata.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Shiga ciki domin samun sanarwar imel kan sabuntawar tsaro da ta sabbin fasaloli, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu bayanan asali na yanayin WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, ba komai! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki lafiya kalau.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓin shiga domin kada ku rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ku taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizonku kuma ya fi yin abin da kuke buƙata.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin hanyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano rukunin yanar gizo %s a cikin hanyar sadarwar da har yanzu suke jiran kulawarku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafi/shafuka %d da har yanzu suke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kuna son amfani da %s a kan waɗancan rukunonin yanar gizon, da fatan za a shigar da lambar lasisin ku a ƙasa sannan ku danna maɓallin kunnawa.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ku iya tsallake shi a yanzu sannan ku kunna lasisin daga baya, a shafin Asusu na matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s ɗinku.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'An haɗa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar kun gama, ku kashe %s sannan ku sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kuna son mu tuntuɓe ku don sabuntawar tsaro da na fasali, abubuwan ilimantarwa, da tayi na lokaci-lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Sashen Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Muna neman afuwa game da rashin jin daɗin kuma muna nan a shirye don taimaka muku idan kuka ba mu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntube Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu da saƙo mai zuwa:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu Ba da Gudunmawa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron'