mfani da gwaji a baya.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Yaya kake son %1$s kawo yanzu? Gwada duk fasalullukanmu na %2$s masu daraja tare da gwajin kyauta na kwanaki %3$d.','Type'=>'Nau\'i','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'An kasa haɗawa da tsarin fayil. Da fatan za a tabbatar da bayanan shaidarku.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'An sami kuskuren API da ba a zata ba yayin sarrafa buƙatarku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna kuma idan har yanzu ba ya aiki, tuntuɓi marubucin %s tare da waɗannan:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a zata ba, sake gwadawa nan da minti 5. Idan matsalar ta ci gaba, tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Cire %s zai kashe lasisin kai tsaye, wanda za ku iya amfani da shi a wani rukunin yanar gizon.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba ya auku.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Kwamishon marasa iyaka.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Sabuntawa marasa iyaka','verbUpdate'=>'Sabunta','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Kuna son ci gaba da sabuntawa?','Update'=>'Sabunta','Update License'=>'Sabunta Lasisi','Upgrade'=>'Haɓaka','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Muhimmiyar Sanarwar Haɓakawa:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Loda kuma kunna sigar da aka saukar','User Dashboard'=>'Dashboard ɗin Mai Amfani','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Yi haƙuri, ba mu iya kammala sabunta imel ɗin ba. Wani mai amfani da wannan imel ɗin ya riga ya yi rajista.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Idan kuna son mika mallakar asusun %1$s zuwa ga %2$s, danna maballin Canja Mallaka.','User ID'=>'ID mai amfani','User key'=>'Makullin mai amfani','Users'=>'Masu amfani','Value'=>'Ƙima','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'An aika da imel ɗin tabbatarwa zuwa %s yanzu. Idan ba ka iya gani ba bayan minti 5, da fatan za a duba akwatin spam ɗinka.','Verified'=>'Tantance','Verify Email'=>'Tabbatar da Imel','product versionVersion'=>'Iri','Version %s was released.'=>'An saki sigar %s.','View details'=>'Duba cikakkun bayanai','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Danna don duba cikakken girman hoton allo %d','View paid features'=>'Duba fasalolin da ake biya','Warning'=>'Gargadi','What is your %s?'=>'Menene %s ɗinka?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'Ihuu!','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Shafin Manhajar WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Kamar akwai kuskure a ɗaya daga cikin bayanan tantancewa. Sabunta Makullin Jama\'a (Public Key), Makullin Sirri (Secret Key) & ID na Mai amfani (User ID) ɗinku, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','%s ago'=>'%s da suka wuce','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'%s ya rage','%s or higher'=>'%s ko mafi girma','%s\'s paid features'=>'Kayan aiki na biyan kuɗi na %s','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'Shirin %s','%s rating'=>'Kimanin %s','%s ratings'=>'%s kimantawa','%s sec'=>'daƙiƙa %s','%s star'=>'Tauraro %s','%s stars'=>'Taurari %s','%s time'=>'Lokacin %s','%s times'=>'sau %s','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Kayi nasarar sabunta %s ɗinka.','as annual periodyear'=>'shekara','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'I','You are all good!'=>'Kome yana lafiya ƙalau!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Kuna da mataki ɗaya kawai ya rage - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Kamar kuna da sabon fitowar.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Ya kamata ku karɓi %3$s don %1$s a cikin akwatin saƙonku a %2$s a cikin mintuna 5 masu zuwa.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Lambar Akwatin Gidan Wasiƙa',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s don samun damar shiga sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na siga %2$s, da tallafi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Sabuntawar tsaro ta atomatik da fasali ta %1$s da kuma ayyukan da aka biya za su ci gaba da aiki ba tare da tsangwama ba har zuwa %2$s (ko lokacin da lasisinku ya ƙare, duk wanda ya fara zuwa).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s domin samun damar sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da kuma tallafin sigar %2$s.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba ya faru yayin ƙoƙarin saita yanayin beta na mai amfani.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a sani ba ya faru yayin ƙoƙarin sauya yanayin farin laƙabi na lasisin.','Annual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Ta danna "Fita", %s ba zai ƙara iya ganin sunanku da imel ɗinku ba.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Ta danna "Opt Out", ba za a ƙara aika bayanan bincike zuwa %s ba.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Ta hanyar cire haɗin rukunin yanar gizon, za a share bayanan binciken da aka raba a baya game da %1$s kuma ba za a sake ganin su ga %2$s ba.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ta hanyar ficewa daga raba wannan bayanin tare da uwar garken sabuntawa, dole ne ka riƙa bincika sabbin fitowar %1$s kuma ka saukar da su da kanka sannan ka girka su. Ba wai kawai wahala ba ce, amma rasa sabuntawa na iya jefa rukunin yanar gizonka cikin haɗari tare da haifar da matsalolin dacewa marasa tushe, don haka muna ba da shawarar sosai a bar waɗannan mahimman izini a kunne.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Soke %1$s - Ba na buƙatar kowane sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, ko tallafi don %2$s saboda ba na shirin amfani da %3$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon, ko wani rukunin yanar gizon daban.','Cancel %s?'=>'Soke %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Ana soke %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Ana soke %s...','Click here'=>'Danna nan','Deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon zai cire %s dindindin daga asusun Allon Kula na Mai Amfani naku.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Don isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali ta atomatik, da kuma gudanarwa da kariyar lasisi, %s yana buƙatar:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Don isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da sarrafa lasisi, %s yana buƙatar','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius shine injin ɗinmu na lasisi da sabunta software','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Idan wannan kwafi ne na dogon lokaci, don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa ta atomatik da kuma ayyukan da aka biya bayan %1$s, da fatan za a %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Shiga Tsarin Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Shiga shirin Beta','License'=>'Lasisi','License Key'=>'Mabuɗin Lasisi','License key'=>'Mabuɗin lasisi','Monthly'=>'Na kowane wata','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Sunaye, slugs, juzu\'ai, da kuma ko yana aiki ko a\'a','New Version Available'=>'Akwai Sabon Shafin','Optional'=>'Na zaɓi','Plan'=>'Tsari','Products'=>'Kayan aiki','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanan bincike yana taimakawa wajen samar da ƙarin ayyuka masu dacewa da rukunin yanar gizon ku, guje wa rashin jituwa tsakanin sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata rukunin yanar gizon, da kuma gane yaruka da yankunan da ya kamata a fassara %s da kuma daidaita shi dominsu.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Don ku sami damar sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s bai kasance mai aiki ba.','Subscription'=>'Kudin shiga','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s zai riƙa aika muhimman bayanan lasisi lokaci-lokaci zuwa %2$s domin duba sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da kuma tabbatar da ingancin lasisinku.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ke akwai.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Don tabbatar da dacewa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da manhajoji da jigogi da aka girka.','Trial'=>'Gwajin','View %s State'=>'Duba Yanayin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Bayanin %s na Asali','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ee, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don manufar gwaji, shiryawa, ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisin %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Ya kamata ku karɓi imel ɗin tabbatarwa don %1$s a cikin akwatin saƙonku a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar kun danna maɓallin da ke cikin wannan imel ɗin don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'awanni','license'=>'Lasisin','optional'=>'na zaɓi','products'=>'Kayayyaki','skip'=>'Tsallake','subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','trial'=>'Gwaji','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayayyaki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisin','close a windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi da shi','close windowDismiss'=>'Yi watsi da shi','like websitesSites'=>'Shafuka','nounPricing'=>'Farashi','trial periodTrial'=>'Gwajin kyauta','verbOpt In'=>'Shiga ciki','verbOpt Out'=>'Fice','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','verbUpgrade'=>'Haɓaka','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s da ya gabata','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Tubalan da ke da abubuwan da ake sake nunawa, da samfuran da aka daidaita','WooCommerce products'=>'Kayan WooCommerce','Comments and reviews'=>'Sharhi da bita','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'An fassara ta atomatik daga %s.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Kudaden WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Kudin ƙasa','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Wurin samun kudin canji bai bayar da farashin %s ba, kudin shagon.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" ba kudin da WooCommerce ya sani ba ne, ko kuma kudin shagon ne da kansa.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Shigar da ƙimar da ta fi sifili don %s, kamar 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Matakan zagayawa da ƙarshen farashi adadi ne, kamar 0.05 ko 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Filaye na musamman (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Zaɓi fassara, kwafa ko barin fanko ga kowane fili.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Fom-fom (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Ina shigar da farashin da kaina','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Babban Bankin Turai, ana sabuntawa kowace rana (kyauta, ba a buƙatar asusu)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Babban Bankin Turai ya amsa %d. An ci gaba da riƙe ƙimar kwanan nan.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Ciyarwar Babban Bankin Turai ba ta ƙunshi kowane farashi ba. An riƙe farashin ƙarshe.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Waccan hanyar samun kudin canji ba ta samuwa.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Kayan aikin SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Rubutun jigo da na\'urar ƙari','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Wannan jigo ko plugin ɗin ba ya aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Ba a iya kammala aikin ba. Sake gwadawa, kuma idan ya ci gaba da kasawa, tuntuɓi mai kula da rukunin yanar gizon.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Wata ƙima da ake buƙata ta ɓace ko kuma ba ta da tsari mai kyau. Duba tsarin shigarwar (input schema) ƙwarewar.','The site refused the request.'=>'Shafin ya ƙi amincewa da buƙatar.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Walaƙan AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Bada damar mataimaka na AI kamar Claude, Cursor ko VS Code su yi aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizo a madadin ku ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga azaman mai amfani da WordPress tare da kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace kuma suna iya yin abin da aka ba wannan mai amfani izini kawai.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakilan AI suna buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko kuma na gaba. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ba da izinin wakilan AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Kashe: kayan aikin da ke ƙasa da hanyoyinsu na REST ba a yi musu rajista ko kaɗan ba.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adireshin haɗi (matsayar MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta manhaja don mai amfani da kai','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ƙara wannan a saitunan MCP na manhajar AI ɗinka, tare da sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: sanya wannan bayanin a ƙarƙashin "servers" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin "mcpServers" ba.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Kayan aikin da wakilin AI zai iya amfani da su a nan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Jagorar mai amfani: Wakilan AI da MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Takardun mai haɓakawa: iyawa, REST da MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'Fassara abun cikin wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma duba fassarorinsa tare da Tranzly.','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'Harsuna, fassara da matsayin fassara.','List languages'=>'Jera harsuna','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'Yana lissafa harsunan rukunin yanar gizon. Na farkon shi ne harshen da aka rubuta asalin abun cikin.','List translation engines'=>'Jera injinan fassara','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'Yana lissafa injunan fassara, ko an saita kowannensu, da kuma wanda ake amfani da shi idan ba a ambaci kowanne ba.','Translate a post or page'=>'Fassara rubutu ko shafi','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'Yana fassara rubutu ko shafi guda zuwa ɗaya ko fiye na yarukan rukunin yanar gizon ta hanyar amfani da injin fassara, yana ƙirƙirar kowace fassara ko sabunta ta. Sabbin fassarori tsari ne na share-fage (drafts) sai dai idan publish ya zama true. Ana tsallake fassarar da wani mutum ya gyara sai dai idan force ya zama true.','Language codes from tranzly/list-languages, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'Lambobin yare daga tranzly/list-languages, misali de_DE, ko kawai de lokacin da Jamusanci ɗaya kawai aka lissafa.','An engine id from tranzly/list-engines; the default engine when omitted.'=>'ID na inji daga tranzly/list-engines; tsohon inji idan an cire shi.','Translation status'=>'Matsayin fassara','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'Tare da ID na rubutu: fassarar wannan rubutu a kowane yare, ko ya wuce lokaci, da wanda ya rubuta shi. Idan babu: adadin shafin da aka fassara, a kowane yare.','Translate my site'=>'Fassara shafina','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'Tsarin aiki mai jagora: wakili yana bincika yaruka da inji, yana kimanta kuɗin da za a kashe, kuma yana fassara abin da ya ɓace, tare da tambaya kafin ya kashe kuɗi ko ya wallafa.','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'Harsunan da za a fassara zuwa gare su, misali Jamusanci da Faransanci.','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'Fassara wannan rukunin yanar gizo na WordPress zuwa: %s. Matakai: 1) kira tranzly-list-languages; idan wani yare ya ɓace, tambaye ni kafin a ƙara shi da tranzly-update-settings; 2) kira tranzly-list-engines kuma ka tabbata an saita guda ɗaya (in ba haka ba ka gaya mini maɓallin da za a ƙara); 3) kira tranzly-translation-status don duk rukunin yanar gizon da tranzly-estimate don abin da ya ɓace, kuma ka gaya mini kuɗin kafin a kashe komai; 4) bayan na amince, fassara tare da tranzly-bulk-translate idan yana samuwa (Pro), in ba haka ba rubutu bayan rubutu tare da tranzly-translate-post; 5) sabbin fassarori za su kasance a matsayin daftari sai dai idan na ce a buga; 6) gama da tranzly-translation-status kuma jera abin da ya rage a ɓace.','Name at least one language.'=>'Sanya aƙalla harshe ɗaya.','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'Karanta sarrafa sharhi (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'Yana mayar da ko ana raba sharhi a cikin harsuna ko ana ajiye su ga kowane harshe.','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'Sauya sarrafa sharhi (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'Yana raba sharhi a duk fassarorin rubutu ko adana su ga kowane harshe (yanayi).','Read the display options'=>'Karanta zaɓuɓɓukan nunawa','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'Yana mayar da mai canza yare da zaɓuɓɓukan nuna yabo.','Change the display options'=>'Sauya zaɓuɓɓukan nuni','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'Yana canza mai canzawa (salo, tutoci, sunaye, wurin zama) da layin yabo.','Read the DeepL usage'=>'Karanta amfani da DeepL','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'Yana mayar da haruffan da aka yi amfani da su da iyakar mabuɗin DeepL da aka ajiye a wannan watan.','Read the engine settings'=>'Karanta saitunan inji','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines, each engine\'s state and this month\'s spend.'=>'Yana mayar da injin na asali da na madadin, injunan kowane harshe, halin kowane inji da kuma abin da aka kashe a wannan watan.','Change the engine settings'=>'Sauya saitunan inji','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine and per-language engines (default, fallback, per_lang). Per-language engines and fallback are Pro.'=>'Yana saita tsohon inji, injin madadin da injina na kowane harshe (default, fallback, per_lang). Injina na kowane harshe da madadin inji na Pro ne.','Save an engine key'=>'Ajiye mabuɗin inji','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'Yana adana maɓallin API (da yanki don Microsoft) na DeepL, Google ko Microsoft; barin shi fanko yana cire shi. Ana adana maɓallan a ɓoye kuma ba a taɓa dawo da su ba.','Estimate a translation'=>'Kiyasta fassara','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'Yana kimanta haruffa da kuɗin fassara rubuce-rubuce (posts ko post_type) zuwa yaruka (langs) tare da inji, kafin a kashe komai.','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin da aka fassara (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token for tranzly/import-translation-file.'=>'Yana loda fayil ɗin Tranzly XLIFF ko CSV (abun ciki, sunan fayil) da aka fassara a wani wuri; yana ba da amsar token don tranzly/import-translation-file.','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'Jera manhajoji da za a yi ƙaura daga gare su (Pro)','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'Yana jera bayanan WPML, Polylang da TranslatePress da aka samu a wannan rukunin yanar gizon waɗanda za a iya shigo da su.','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'Yi ƙaura daga WPML, Polylang ko TranslatePress (Pro)','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'Yana shigo da shafi na gaba na fassarori daga wani manhajar ƙari mai harsuna da yawa (yanayi: dry-run ko run; alamar nuni).','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'Rubuta fayil ɗin da aka shigo da shi (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'Yana rubuta shafi na gaba na rubuce-rubuce daga fayil ɗin fassara da aka loda (maimaita tare da after har sai an gama).','Read the integrations'=>'Karanta haɗe-haɗen','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'Yana lissafa manhajojin SEO, WooCommerce, maginin shafi da na fom da Tranzly ke goyan baya kuma suke aiki a nan.','List translation jobs'=>'Jera ayyukan fassara','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'Yana lissafa ayyukan fassarar bayan fage, sabbi a gaba, tare da ci gaba.','Start a translation job'=>'Fara aikin fassara','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'Yana fara aikin bango wajen fassara rubutukan da aka lissafa (posts) ko gaba ɗaya nau\'in rubutu zuwa harsuna (langs).','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'Sake gwadawa ko mikawa abu da ya gaza','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'Yana sake gwada abin da ya gaza (aiki: retry, za a iya amfani da wani injin) ko kuma ya sanya masa alama don fassarar hannu (aiki: by-hand).','Read a job\'s progress'=>'Karanta ci gaban aiki','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'Yana mayar da ci gaban aiki ɗaya da ƙididdigarsa.','Cancel a job'=>'Soke aiki','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'Yana dakatar da aiki; ana adana fassarorin da aka riga aka yi.','Read a job\'s failures'=>'Karanta gazawar aiki','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'Yana lissafa abubuwan aikin da suka faskara tare da dalilin kowanne.','Read the licence'=>'Karanta lasisin','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Yana mayar da shirin Tranzly na wannan rukunin yanar gizo, matsayin lasisi, ranar sabuntawa, da kuma abin da shirin ya ƙunsa.','Disconnect from support'=>'Cire haɗi daga tallafi','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Yana cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizo daga tallafi.','Read the support connection'=>'Karanta haɗin tallafi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Yana nuna ko wannan rukunin yanar gizon yana haɗe da tallafin Zinn Digital®, kuma a matsayin wane.','Connect to support'=>'Haɗa zuwa tallafi','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Yana haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon da tallafin Zinn Digital® (suna, imel, yarda).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Yarda da binciken tallafi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Yana riƙe da yardar mai gudanarwa na aika bayanan bincike tare da tikitin tallafi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Karanta binciken shafin','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Yana dawo da bayanan bincike da tikitin tallafi zai ɗauka: nau\'o\'i, manhajojin ƙari masu aiki, iyakoki da kuskuran kwanan nan.','Open a support ticket'=>'Bude tikitin tallafi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Yana shigar da tikitin taimako (matsala, saƙo, nau\'i, imel), tare da bayanan binciken wannan rukunin yanar gizon idan mai gudanarwa ya amince. Ba ya taɓa ƙirƙirar bayanan shiga ko aika ɗaya.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Fara gwajin Pro na kyauta','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Yana fara gwajin kwanaki 14 na Tranzly Pro don wannan rukunin yanar gizon (babu buƙatar biyan kuɗi).','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'Karanta shigo da Tranzly 2.x','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'Yana mayar da matsayi da rahoton shigar da fassarori daga Tranzly 2.x.','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'Shigo da fassarorin Tranzly 2.x','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'Yana gudanar da shigo da 2.x: gwaji (rahoto kawai), gudanarwa, ko soke aiki.','Translate an image\'s text'=>'Fassara rubutun hoto','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'Yana ajiye rubutun alt, laƙabi ko bayanin hoto (field) a wani yare (lang).','Read the menus per language'=>'Karanta menu na kowane harshe','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'Yana mayar da menu da kowane yare ke nunawa a kowane wurin menu.','Set the menus per language'=>'Saita menus a kowace harshe','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'Yana ware menu a kowane yare a kowane wuri (taswira).','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'Kariyar fassara ko buɗe ta','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'Yana kare fassara daga cirewa ta hanyar inji (protected: true), ko buɗe ta.','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'Karanta rahoton inganci (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'Yana mayar da rahoton ingancin AI na fassara: maki da sassan da aka yi wa alama.','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'Amince ko ƙi fassarar (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'Yana amincewa da fassara (kuma yana buga ta lokacin da aka buga ta asali) ko kuma mayar da ita baya (hukunci, bayani).','Read a translation side by side'=>'Karanta fassarar gefe da gefe','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'Yana mayar da ɓangarorin fassara kusa da na asali, don dubawa da gyara.','Correct a translation'=>'Gyara fassara','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'Yana adana ɓangarorin da aka gyara na fassara (ɓangarori: maɓalli zuwa rubutu); ana kāre rubutun da aka gyara daga sake fassarawa.','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'Cire hanyar haɗin rubutu daga fassarorinsa','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'Yana fitar da rubutu daga rukunin fassararsa; yana riƙe yarensa.','Read a post\'s translations'=>'Karanta fassarorin rubutu','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'Yana lissafa rukunin fassarar rubutu: membobi na kowane yare tare da taken su, matsayi da hanyar gyarawa.','Create an empty translation'=>'Ƙirƙiri fassarar da ba kowa','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar daftarin fassarar rubutu a cikin wani harshe (lang) don rubutawa da hannu, ba tare da inji ba.','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'Haɗa rubutun da ke akwai a matsayin fassara','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'Yana mai da wani rubutu da ke akwai (makami) fassarar wannan rubutun a wani harshe.','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'Duba fassarori da AI (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'Yana tsara duba ingancin AI na shafi na gaba na fassarorin harshe (ko rubutukan da aka bayar).','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'Binciken SEO na Harsuna da yawa (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'Yana bincika fassarori don neman kanun labarai na SEO da suka ɓace, bayanin martaba, slugs da hreflang a cikin yare, shafi bayan shafi.','Change languages and settings'=>'Sauya harsuna da saituna','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Yana saita harsunan rukunin yanar gizon (harsuna: jerin lamba da suna; na farko shine ainihin harshe), prefix ɗin aji na gaba (front-end), da kuma ko an ba da izinin wakilan AI (MCP).','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'Karanta rubutun jigo da na toshe','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'Yana mayar da rubutun jigo da na toshe (iyaka) a cikin wani yare tare da fassarorinsu.','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'Fassara rubutun jigo da na toshe masu ɓace','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'Yana fassara shafi na gaba na rubutattun kalmomin jigo da na toshe da ba a fassara ba a cikin wani harshe ta amfani da tsohuwar injin (maimaita da after har sai an gama).','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'Gyara rubutun jigo da na toshe','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'Yana adana fassarorin da aka gyara na rubutun jigo da na manhaja (sarƙoƙi); suna zama masu kariya.','Translate what is missing'=>'Fassara abin da ya ɓace','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'Yana sanya fassarar kowane abu da ya ɓace (ko wanda ya daina aiki) a cikin layi don wani yare da nau\'in rubutu.','List what is missing or out of date'=>'Lissafa abin da ya ɓace ko ya wuce yayi','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'Yana jera na asali tare da matsayin fassararsu a wani yare (matsayi: wanda ya ɓace, tsohon yayi, na yanzu), shafi bayan shafi.','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'Karanta rubutun rukunin yanar gizon a wani yare','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'Yana mayar da taken shafi, taken bayani da rubutun widget a cikin wani harshe.','Translate a site text'=>'Fassara rubutun shafi','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'Yana adana rubutun shafi ɗaya (mabuɗi) a cikin harshe, misali taken shafi ko taken bayani.','Translate a category or tag'=>'Fassara rukuni ko lissafi','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'Yana fassara kalma ɗaya (rukuni, alama ko siffar kaya) zuwa wani harshe (lang) ta amfani da inji, yana ƙirƙira ko sabunta fassararsa.','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'Cire hanyar haɗin kalma daga fassarorinta','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'Yana fitar da kalma daga rukunin fassararta.','Read a term\'s translations'=>'Karanta fassarorin wata kalma','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'Yana lissafa rukunin fassarar rukuni ko alama.','Create a term translation by hand'=>'Ƙirƙiri fassarar kalma da hannu','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar fassarar kalma a cikin wani harshe tare da suna, slug da bayanin da kuka bayar.','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'Haɗa kalmar da ke akwai a matsayin fassara','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'Yana mayar da kalmar da ke akwai (makoma) fassarar wannan kalmar a cikin wani harshe.','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'Jera hanyoyin samo rubutun jigo da na toshe (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'Yana lissafa jigogi da ƙarin kayan aiki waɗanda za a iya bincika rubutunsu don fassara, da kuma yawan kirtani da kowannensu yake da shi.','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'Duba jigo ko toshe don rubutu (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'Yana bincikar shafi na gaba na fayilolin PHP na wani bangare don gano rubutun da za a iya fassarawa (maimaita da after har sai an gama).','Read the address settings'=>'Karanta saitunan adireshi','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'Yana mayar da yadda harsuna ke bayyana a cikin adireshi (babban fayil, ƙaramin yanki ko yanki), fassararrun slugs da tushe, da noindex don shafukan da ba a fassara ba.','Change the address settings'=>'Sauya saitin adireshin','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'Yana saita yanayin adireshi (mode), yankunan kowane harshe, tushe da sassan da aka fassara, noindex_untranslated da shawarwarin slug.','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'Kintata fassarar shafin (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'Yana kimanta fassarar duk shafin zuwa wani yare (post_types, scope, engine) kafin a fara shi.','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Karanta saitunan tsarin aiki (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'Yana mayar da fassarar atomatik lokacin bugawa da sabuntawa, bita kafin bugawa, da ƙofa, mai bayarwa da ƙirar binciken ingancin AI.','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Sauya saitunan tsarin aiki (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'Yana saita on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider da quality_model.','Translate the whole site'=>'Fassara dukan rukunin yanar gizon','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'Yana fara ayyukan fassara a bango ga kowane asali na nau\'o\'in abun ciki da aka bayar (duk nau\'o\'in da aka fassara idan ba a bayar da ko ɗaya ba): fassarorin da suka ɓace, waɗanda suka daina aiki, ko duka. Yana mayar da ayyukan da aka fara, ɗaya a kowace harshe.','Check a translation with AI'=>'Duba fassara da AI','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'Yana sa AI ta kwatanta fassara ɗaya da asalin ta sannan ta ba da maki, kuma yana adana rahoton a kan fassarar. Yana amfani da samfurin AI na duba inganci da aka saita a saitunan aikin Tranzly.','The translation\'s post ID (see tranzly/translation-status).'=>'ID ɗin rubutun fassarar (duba tranzly/translation-status).','Export a file for human translators'=>'Fitar da fayil don masu fassara na mutum','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). Import it back with tranzly/upload-translation-file.'=>'Yana mayar da fayil ɗin XLIFF ko CSV (a matsayin rubutu) tare da asalin rubutun da fassarorinsu a cikin harshe ɗaya, don mai fassara ko hukumar fassara: rubuce-rubucen da aka bayar, ko shafi na har zuwa asali guda 100 na nau\'in abun ciki a cikin wani yanayi (wanda ya ɓace, tsohon yayi, wanda aka fassara ko duka; maimaita tare da after). Shigo da shi baya tare da tranzly/upload-translation-file.','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'Kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba (sunayen alama da na kaya).','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'Kowane lambar yare: asalin kalma => fassarar da ake amfani da ita a koyaushe.','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'A kowane lambar yare: matsayin ladabi (na asali, ƙari, raguwa) da umarnin salon rubutu.','Read the glossary'=>'Karanta ƙamus ɗin','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'Yana mayar da kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba, fassarorin ƙayyadaddun kalmomi da yanayin kowace harshe.','Update the glossary'=>'Sabunta ƙamus ɗin','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'Yana maye gurbin ɓangarorin ƙamus ɗin da kuka aika (kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba, fassarorin kalmomi, yanayin sauti); ɓangarorin da kuka bari ana adana su. Ana amfani da shi ta kowace manhaja tun daga fassara ta gaba.','Language suggestion'=>'Shawarar harshe','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Wannan shafin yana samuwa a cikin %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Karanta shi da %s','No thanks'=>'A\'a, na gode','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Zaɓi yadda yaruka za su bayyana a cikin adiresoshinku: babban fayil, yanki na ƙasa, yanki daban ko ma\'aunin tambaya.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Kananan yankuna da keɓaɓɓun yankuna na kowane harshe na cikin Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Dole ne manyan fayilolin harshe su zama jeri.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" ba zai iya zama babban fayil ɗin harshe ba. Yi amfani da ƙananan haruffa 2 zuwa 12, lambobi ko dashes, daban-daban ga kowane harshe, kuma ba kalmar da WordPress ke amfani da ita ba.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Dole ne yankunan su zama jeri.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" ba sunan yanki ba ne, kamar example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Kowace yare tana buƙatar yankin kanta.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Kalmomin adireshin da aka fassara dole ne su zama jeri.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Dole ne a jera fassararrun kalmomin adireshi ga kowane harshe.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da "%s" a cikin adireshi ba. Yi amfani da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi da alamun raba kalmomi (hyphens).','This setting is on or off.'=>'Wannan saitin yana kunne ko a kashe.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Ɓoye shafukan da ba a fassara ba daga injunan bincike wani ɓangare ne na Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Harsuna','Languages (side by side)'=>'Harsuna (kusa da juna)','Add to Menu'=>'Ƙara zuwa Menu','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'A rukunin yanar gizonku, wannan abu yana nuna harsunan rukunin yanar gizon, inda kowannensu ke haɗawa zuwa shafi na yanzu a cikin wancan harshen.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Hanyoyin haɗi zuwa wannan shafi a cikin kowane yarenku.','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lambar yare','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Design'=>'Tsari','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane yare a matsayin','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Nuna tutoci (tuta ƙasa ce, ba yare ba)','List'=>'Jeri','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Buttons'=>'Maballan','Dropdown'=>'Zaɓin da ke buɗewa','Language codes'=>'Lambobin harshe','Flags'=>'Tutoci','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa harshen yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ɓoye harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafi zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Dora a tsaye','Accessible label'=>'Alamar da ake iya shiga','Text'=>'Rubutu','Background'=>'Bayan fage','Current language text'=>'Rubutun yaren yanzu','Current language background'=>'Bayan fage na harshen yanzu','Border'=>'Iyaƙa','Corner radius'=>'Radius ɗin kusurwa','Space between languages'=>'Tazara tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girmar rubutu','Switcher'=>'Mai sauyawa','(no title)'=>'(babu take)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Babu abin da za a gyara a nan.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Ba a fassara kowane irin nau\'in abun ciki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Ba a fassara wannan nau\'in abun ciki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Babu abin da za a fassara a wannan zaɓin.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla yare ɗaya da za a fassara zuwa gare shi.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin fitar da fassarori ba.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin XLIFF ko CSV da za a shigo da shi.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Wannan ba fayil ɗin Tranzly XLIFF ko CSV ba ne. Fitar da ɗaya da farko, fassara shi, sannan shigo da shi nan.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya adana fayil ɗin don shigo da shi ba. Bincika ko za a iya rubutawa a babban fayil ɗin lodawa (uploads).','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Wannan shigo da bayanan baya nan kuma. Sake loda fayil ɗin.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Wannan shafin ba ya kan wannan shafin yanar gizon kuma.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Fayil ɗin na yare ne da wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da shi.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ba a iya danganta %1$s %2$d ba: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Rubutu #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'Ba a sami wani bayani daga wannan manhaja a wannan rukunin yanar gizo ba.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Wannan ba fassarar wani abu ba ne a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','There is no text to check.'=>'Babu rubutun da za a duba.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Saitunan AI ba sa cikin wannan ginin.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI bai ba da amsa ba.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Samfurin AI bai kimanta kowane sashe na wannan shafi ba. Sake gwadawa, ko zaɓi wani samfurin.','Translator'=>'Mai Fassara','Translation reviewer'=>'Mai duba fassara','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Wani mai bita ya nemi sauye-sauye ga wannan fassarar.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Wani mai bita ya nemi sauye-sauye a wannan fassarar: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Wannan fassarar tana jiran mai bita. Buga ta (a matsayin mai bita) yana amincewa da ita.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Fassara ce kawai za a iya dubawa.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Zaɓi abin da zai faru idan asali ya canza: ba komai, sanya alamar fassarorin a matsayin wadanda suka tsufa, ko sake fassara su.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Kogin inganci wani maki ne daga 0 zuwa 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Sake nuna shawarwarin da aka ɓoye a kan Bayanin Gabaɗaya','All'=>'Duka','%d selected'=>'An zaɓi %d' . "\0" . 'An zaɓi %d','Nothing matches.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace.','Select all on this page'=>'Zaɓi duka a wannan shafin','Select'=>'Zaɓa','Pages'=>'Shafuka','Previous'=>'Na baya','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Shafi %1$d daga cikin %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Saita %s a cikin mintuna kaɗan','Start setup'=>'Fara saitawa','This site'=>'Wannan shafin','Edition'=>'Buga','Sites on this licence'=>'Shafuka a kan wannan lasisin','Version'=>'Sigar','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Wannan yana kama da kwafin gwaji ko na cikin na\'ura, don haka ba ya cinye shafi a lasisinku.','See what Pro adds'=>'Duba abin da Pro ke ƙarawa','Go to'=>'Je zuwa','Personal'=>'Na kai','Business'=>'Kasuwanci','Agency'=>'Hukuma','Any number of sites'=>'Kowane adadin shafuka','Unlimited sites'=>'Shafuka marasa iyaka','%d site'=>'shafi %d' . "\0" . 'shafuka %d','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Gwajin %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Gwajin ku ya fara. Sake loda shafin don ganin kowane fasalin Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Ba a iya fara gwajin ba.','Feature'=>'Siffa','Included'=>'An haɗa','Not included'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Your licence'=>'Lasasinku','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d cikin %2$d ana amfani da su','Renews'=>'Yana sabuntawa','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Kofofin gwaji na staging, test da localhost na shafi kyauta ne kuma ba a taɓa ƙidaya su a cikin ƙayyadadden adadin shafukanku ba.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Tsarin ku ya haɗa da fifikon tallafi.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Sarrafa lasisinku da biyan kuɗi','Get more with Pro'=>'Sami ƙari tare da Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Fara gwajin kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a buƙatar katin kuɗi' . "\0" . 'Fara gwajin kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a bukatar katin kuɗi','See plans and prices'=>'Duba tsare-tsare da farashin su','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Kuna amfani da Tranzly da Page Builder Sandwich tare? Kunshin ya haɗa da duka plugins na Pro a kan farashi mai sauƙi.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Lasasinku ya ƙare. Sabunta shi don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da abubuwan Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sabunta yanzu','Compare the plans'=>'Kwatanta tsare-tsaren','Search features'=>'Bincika fasaloli','Area'=>'Wuri','Included in'=>'Ciki har da','No feature matches.'=>'Babu fasalin da ya dace.','Features by plan'=>'Siffofi ta hanyar tsari','Hide'=>'Ɓoye','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Kuna iya kunna shi a shafin Plugins','Install it'=>'Shigar da shi','Overview'=>'Taƙaitaccen bayani','Setup'=>'Saitawa','Plans and licence'=>'Tsarika da laisin','Add-ons'=>'Ƙarin abubuwa','Get help'=>'Nemi taimako','Feedback'=>'Sharhi','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya ajiye zaɓinka ba.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana yanayin saitin ba.','Match my computer'=>'Daidaita da kwamfuta ta','Light'=>'Fari','Dark'=>'Duhu','Colour scheme'=>'Tsarin launi','Help'=>'Taimako','Guide to this screen'=>'Jagora zuwa wannan allon','Take the tour'=>'Fara yawon shakatawa','Get help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ba da rahoton matsala','Plugin screens'=>'Fuskokin plugin','That could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya ajiye wannan ba.','Before you contact support'=>'Kafin ka tuntuɓi sashen tallafi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ana aika buƙatarku daga wannan shafi zuwa %s, waɗanda ke yin wannan manhaja. Muna aika:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adireshin imel dinka da sunanka, domin mu iya ba da amsa;','the subject and message you write;'=>'batun da kuma saƙon da kuke rubutawa;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID ɗin lasisin ku, domin abokan ciniki masu biya su sami fifiko;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kawai idan ka yi alama a kai: bayanan shafi (nau\'ukan WordPress da PHP, jigo, manhajoji na plugins, tsakure daga bayanan kuskure wanda aka cire kalmomin sirri da adiresoshin imel), wadanda za ka iya karantawa kafin aikawa;','Privacy policy'=>'Manufar sirri','I agree, continue'=>'Na yarda, ci gaba','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ba a iya bincika haɗin ba.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Wannan bai yi aiki ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Masu taimako na Zinn Digital® sun cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taimakon Zinn Digital® ba ya sake gane wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Ka cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Connect this site to support'=>'Haɗa wannan shafi da sashin tallafi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'An haɗa. Amsoshi za su tafi zuwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ba a haɗa ba. Har yanzu kuna iya aika buƙata tare da adireshin imel ɗinku a ƙasa; haɗawa yana kiyaye rubuta shi a kowane lokaci.','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','Your name (optional)'=>'Sunanka (na zaɓi)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Na yarda a haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizo da tallafin Zinn Digital®. Wannan yana aika adireshin rukunin yanar gizon, nau\'ikan WordPress da PHP da nau\'in manhajar plugin, kuma ana iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga nan ko ta Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Haɗa','I need help'=>'Ina buƙatar taimako','Report a bug'=>'Ba da rahoton matsala','Send feedback'=>'Aika da martani','Request a feature'=>'Nemi wani fasali','The site details could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta bayanan shafin ba.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya aika buƙatarku ba. Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da buƙatun fasali','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'An aika. Lambar bayaninka ita ce %s, kuma amsanmu za ta zo ta imel.','What is it about?'=>'Game da me yake?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Amsa zuwa (imel)','Subject'=>'Maudu\'i','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Me kuka yi, me kuka yi tsammani, kuma me ya faru a maimakon haka?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Haɗa da cikakkun bayanan rukunin yanar gizo (nau\'o\'i, jigo, ƙarin manhajoji, ɓangaren rajistar kuskure)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Duba ainihin abin da aka aika','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa…','Send'=>'Aika','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Mataki na %1$d daga cikin %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Rufe yawon shakatawa','Back'=>'Koma baya','Everything in one place'=>'Komai a wuri guda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Wadannan shafukan suna kaiwa zuwa kowane allon manhajar: saitawa, saituna, lasisin ku, taimako da ƙari.','Help on every screen'=>'Taimako a kowane allo','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Bude wannan menu don jagorar allon da kake kai, wannan rangadin, ko don neman taimako daga gare mu.','Light or dark'=>'Fari ko duhu','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Zaɓi mai haske, mai duhu, ko dai-dai da na kwamfutarka. Zaɓinka ana tuna shi ne don kai kaɗai.','Welcome'=>'Barka da zuwa','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Wannan ɗan gajeren rangadi yana nuna inda abubuwa suke. Za ku iya fita daga ciki a kowane lokaci tare da Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Shafinku a takaice','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ana nuna ci gaban saitin da kuma tsarin ku a nan, tare da abu na gaba da ya dace a yi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Tsarinku, shafukan nawa yake ɗauka, da kuma ko wannan kofi na shafin yana ƙirguwa a cikin wannan iyaka.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gwada Pro ko haɓaka','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Fara gwajin kyauta ba tare da katin banki ba, inganta, ko sabuntawa, duka daga nan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kowane fasali da tsarin da ya ƙunsa. Nemi fasali ko nuna yanki ɗaya a lokaci guda.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Karin bayani daga Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Karin kayan aiki da ke aiki da wannan, da kuma ayyuka daga ƙungiya ɗaya. Katinan da kuka ɓoye a wasu allunan za a iya sake nuna su a nan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Haɗa domin samun taimako cikin sauri','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Haɗawa zaɓi ne. Yana ba ku damar aika buƙatu ba tare da buga imel ɗinku a kowane lokaci ba, kuma kuna iya cire haɗin duk lokacin da kuke so.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ba da rahoton matsala','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Bayyana abin da ya faru. Za ka iya zaɓar ko za a haɗa bayanin shafin, kuma za ka iya duba ainihin abin da ya ƙunsa tukunna.','Tell us what to build'=>'Faɗa mana abin da za mu gina','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Aika shawara, buƙatar sabon fasali ko kowane martani. Zai tafi kai tsaye ga ƙungiyar.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Wannan yana ɗaukar \'yan mintoci kuma yana saita %s domin ya yi aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon nan take. Kuna iya canza komai daga baya.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Kuna a shirye. Idan wani abu bai yi aiki kamar yadda ake tsammani ba, muna nan kusa da ku da dannawa ɗaya kawai.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Mataki na %1$d cikin %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Gama','Skip setup'=>'Tsallake saiti','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock, Shugaba na Zinn Digital® Ltd ne ya gina shi','Version %s'=>'Shafi %s','Tranzly website'=>'Gidan yanar gizon Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba tsare-tsaren Pro da farashinsu','Languages'=>'Harsuna','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Harshe na farko shine wanda aka rubuta abin cikin ku da shi. Masu ziyara suna canzawa tare da toshewar sauya harshe.','(default)'=>'(na asali)','Find a language'=>'Nemi yare','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Rubuta sunansa a cikin yarenka ko a cikin nasa yaren, sannan ka zaɓe shi. Lambar da sunan da ke ƙasa za su cika da kansu.','Locale code'=>'Lambar yanki','For example fr_FR'=>'Misali fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Suna (na zaɓi)','For example Français'=>'Misali Français','Add language'=>'Ƙara yare','Front-end output'=>'Sakamakon gaba-gaba','Class name prefix'=>'Dafin sunan aji','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji da manhajar ke nunawa a shafukanku yana farawa ne da wannan dafaffiyar gaba, don haka shafukan ba sa bayyana manhajar da ta gina su. Ƙananan haruffa ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, da suka fara da harafi.','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar sigar beta a matsayin sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon yana karɓar ingantattun sigogi ne kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Sauya wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana ba da nau\'ukan beta ga shigarwar Pro mai lasisi waɗanda aka haɗa da asusun su. Da zarar an haɗa, za ku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Save settings'=>'Ajiye saituna','First engine that is set up'=>'Injin na farko da aka saita','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'An ajiye makulli. An adana shi a ɓoye kuma ba za a sake nuna shi ba.','Engine settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saitunan inji.','Glossary saved.'=>'An ajiye ƙamus.','Your keys'=>'Mabuɗanku','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly yana kiran ayyukan fassara tare da asusunka na kanka. Ana adana maɓallan a ɓoye a cikin ma\'ajiyar bayananka kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga sabis ɗin da suka dace da shi. Ana saita maɓallan samfurin AI a cikin saitunan AI.','%s API key'=>'Makullin API na %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'An ajiye: %s. Shigar da sabon mabuɗi don maye gurbinsa, ko ajiye fili marar komai don cire shi.','No key saved.'=>'Ba a ajiye mabuɗi ba.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Yankin Azure (bar shi babu komai don albarkatun duniya)','Save key'=>'Ajiye kewayen maɓalli','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Duba yawan amfani na da DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'An yi amfani da haruffa %1$s cikin %2$s a wannan lokacin lissafin kuɗi.','Which engine translates'=>'Wanne inji ke fassara','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Ba a saita wani inji ba tukuna. Ajiye mabuɗi a sama (ko saita samfurin AI) don fara fassara.','Default engine'=>'Injini na asali','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Inji na daban ga kowane harshe, madadin kai-tsaye da ƙa\'idojin kashe kuɗi na kowane wata abubuwan musamman ne na Tranzly Pro.','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Kamus da kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Kada a taɓa fassara waɗannan kalmomi (ɗaya a kowane layi)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Sunayen alama da na samfur suna nan yadda suke, tare da kowace inji.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Fassarorin da aka fi so da salon sauti ga kowane harshe fasaloli ne na Tranzly Pro.','Save glossary'=>'Ajiye ƙamus','Settings'=>'Saituna','Translation engine'=>'Injin fassara','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Abin da Tranzly ke fassarawa a wannan shafin','found, translated with your content'=>'an samo, an fassara tare da abin da ke ciki','not on this site'=>'ba a wannan shafin ba','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Tare da Tranzly Pro: shafukan Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen da WPBakery; komai a cikin WooCommerce, tare da farashi a kudin mai ziyara; filayen SEO na Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress da All in One SEO; filayen ACF, Meta Box da Pods; fom-fom da imel ɗinsu; rubutun jigonka da na manhajojin ƙari; da kuma sharhi da bita.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Rubutun kanti da imel','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Jikokin imel da kanun labarai, sunayen hanyoyin biyan kuɗi da na aikawa, da sanarwar biya. Imel ɗin kowane oda yana fita a yaren da aka yi shi.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Fom-fom da imelolinsu','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Kowane fom yana adana jeri ɗaya na abubuwan da aka shigar; lakabansa, maɓallansa, saƙonninsa da imel ɗinsa suna bayyana a cikin yaren maziyarta.','Saved.'=>'An ajiye.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Ba a ayyana kowane filin ACF, Meta Box ko Pods ba tukuna.','Field'=>'Filin rubutu','Where'=>'Ina','In a translation'=>'A cikin fassara','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Abin da ke faruwa da %s a cikin fassara','Translate it'=>'Fassara shi','Copy it as it is'=>'Kwafi shi yadda yake','Leave it empty'=>'Bar shi a wofi','The shop’s currency'=>'Kudin kanti','Currencies'=>'Kuɗaɗe','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Nuna farashin a wasu kuɗaɗen (na kantin kansa shine %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Farashin canji','Rates last updated %s.'=>'An sabunta farashin a ƙarshe %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Ba a samo farashin ba tukuna.','Update the rates now'=>'Sabunta farashin a yanzu','New currency'=>'Sabuwar kuɗi','Choose…'=>'Zaɓa…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Kudi (a kowane 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Rubuta kudi yana kiyaye shi: sabuntawar yau da kullun ba za ta canza shi ba.','Rounding'=>'Kewayawa','None'=>'Babu','Round up'=>'Kintata zuwa sama','Round to the nearest'=>'Karkata zuwa mafi kusa','Round down'=>'Karkata ƙasa','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Kintata zuwa (misali 1, 0.05 ko 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Farashin yana ƙarewa da (misali 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ƙara kuɗi','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Wane baƙi ne ke ganin wane kudin','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Ta ƙasa: lambar ƙasa mai haruffa biyu (misali CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Masu ziyara daga %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Bari maziyarta su zaba (gajeren lamba [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Farashoji yanzu sun dogara ne akan kuki ko kuma ƙasar mai ziyara: tabbatar da cewa cache ɗin shafinku ya bambanta ta hanyar kuki na "tranzly_currency", ko ya cire shafukan kantin sayarwa.','Save currencies'=>'Ajiye kudade','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Kalmomin da jigonka da manhajojin ƙari (plugins) ke fitarwa da kansu (maballai, lakabi). Karanta jigo ko manhajar ƙari sau ɗaya, sannan ka fassara rubutunsa a nan; fassararka tana da fifiko bisa ta manhajar ƙarin.','%d texts'=>'%d rubututtuka','not read yet'=>'ba a karanta ba tukuna','Read again'=>'Sake karantawa','Read its text'=>'Karanta rubutunsa','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'An fara aiki da fassarori %d da za a yi. Yana gudana a bango: za ku iya rufe wannan shafin.','Queued again.'=>'An sake saka a jerin jira.','Running'=>'Yana aiki','Finished'=>'Kammala','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Fara saita injin fassara a shafin Injina.','Translate every'=>'Fassara kowane','Into'=>'Cikin','With'=>'Tare da','Each language’s own engine'=>'Injin kowane harshe na kansa','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Buga fassarorin (in ba haka ba za a ajiye su a matsayin zayyana)','Estimate the cost'=>'Kiyasta kudin','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Rubututtuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s. Farashin wannan injin ba a san shi a gaba ba.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Rubututtuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s: kusan $%3$s akan asusun kanku.','Start translating'=>'Fara fassara','Jobs'=>'Ayyuka','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Babu ayyukan fassara tukunna.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Aiki %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d cikin %2$d an fassara, %3$d sun gaza, %4$d an tsallake (kariya ko a wannan yaren a riga)','Stop this job'=>'Tsayar da wannan aiki','See what failed and why'=>'Duba abin da ya gaza da kuma dalili','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Language'=>'Harshe','What went wrong'=>'Abin da ya ɓaci','Fix it'=>'Gyara shi','Retry with'=>'Sake gwadawa da','The same engine'=>'Injin ɗaya','Retry'=>'Sake gwadawa','Translate by hand'=>'Fassara da hannu','Menus saved.'=>'An ajiye menus.','%d texts translated.'=>'An fassara rubututtuka %d.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'An ajiye. An kare gyare-gyarenka daga fassarar na\'ura.','The same menu, translated'=>'Kayan aiki ɗaya, an fassara','A separate menu per language'=>'Kowane yare yana da menu daban','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Ta tsohuwar hanya ana fassara kowane mazaɓa: hanyoyin haɗin sa na kaiwa zuwa shafukan da aka fassara, tare da lakabinsu. Zaɓi mazaɓa na kansa don wani harshe a nan maimakon haka.','Shared text'=>'Rubutun da aka raba','Which text'=>'Wane rubutu','Menu labels'=>'Alamomin menu','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Taken shafi, taken bayani da widget','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Samfura, kwan-gaba, kwan-baya da ƙira','Translate the missing text'=>'Fassara rubutun da ya ɓace','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Babu rubutun da za a fassara a nan.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Wani mutum ya gyara, an kare','Save corrections'=>'Ajiye gyare-gyare','Languages and settings'=>'Harsuna da saituna','Engines'=>'Injinoni','Translation jobs'=>'Ayyukan fassara','Addresses and SEO'=>'Adiresoshi da SEO','Language switchers'=>'Masu sauya harshe','SEO audit'=>'Binciken SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Kayan aiki da rubutun da aka raba','Integrations'=>'Haɗe-haɗe','No meta description'=>'Babu bayanin meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Sigar yare da baƙi ba za su iya buɗewa ba (daftari, na sirri ko mai kalmar sirri)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Adireshin har yanzu yana amfani da kalmomin asali','Still holds the original text'=>'Har yanzu yana ɗauke da ainihin rubutun','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Binciken SEO na harsuna da yawa wani yanki ne na Tranzly Pro. Yana gano kwatancen meta da ba su nan, fashewar hreflang, adiresoshin da ba a fassara ba da kuma kwafin abun ciki, ga kowane harshe.','Language to audit'=>'Yaren da za a bincika','Run the audit'=>'Gudanar da binciken','Check the next pages'=>'Duba shafuka na gaba','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'An duba shafuka %1$d, an sami matsaloli %2$d.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'An duba dukkan yaren.','Page'=>'Shafi','Problem'=>'Matsala','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Aiki %1$d ya fara: ana fassara shafuka %2$d a bango. Bibiye shi a Ayyukan fassara.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'Ana duba fassarori guda %d a ɓoye. Sakamakon zai bayyana a nan da zaran ya iso.','Missing'=>'Ya ɓace','Out of date'=>'Ya wuce lokaci','Translated'=>'An fassara','Edited by a person'=>'Wani mutum ne ya gyara','Machine translated'=>'Fassara ta atomatik','Waiting for review'=>'Ana jiran bita','Needs a human look'=>'Yana buƙatar duba na ɗan adam','Everything'=>'Komai','Up to date'=>'Na zamani','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly na kan gano tsoffin fassarorin da suka daina aiki. Yawan waɗanda "suka daina aiki" zai ƙaru yayin da yake yin hakan.','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','All content'=>'Duk abun ciki','Average quality'=>'Matsakaicin inganci','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'An fassara %1$d (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Nuna','Translate everything missing'=>'Fassara duk abin da ya ɓace','Update everything out of date'=>'Sabunta duk abin da ya wuce lokaci','Check the quality with AI'=>'Duba ingancin tare da AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Sake fassara shafukan da ke da ƙarancin maki','Nothing here.'=>'Babu komai a nan.','Quality'=>'Inganci','by a person'=>'daga wani mutum','waiting for review'=>'Ana jiran bita','Show more'=>'Nuna ƙari','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Fassara duka shafin gaba ɗaya (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Tare da Tranzly Pro, zaɓi nau\'ikan abun ciki da harsuna, duba ƙididdiga, kuma fassara dukan rukunin yanar gizon a lokaci ɗaya.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'An fara ayyukan bango guda %d, guda ɗaya ga kowane harshe. Bi su a cikin Ayyukan fassara.','Content types'=>'Nau\'o\'in abun ciki','What to translate'=>'Abin da za a fassara','Only what is missing'=>'Abin da ya ɓace kawai','Only what is out of date'=>'Abin da ya wuce lokaci kawai','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Kowane abu (shafukan da mutum ya gyara suna nan yadda suke)','Estimate'=>'Kiyasta','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Shafuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s. Wannan injin ba ya wallafa farashi.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'shafuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s, kusan $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Nemo rubutu','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'Karin %d: rubuta a "Find a text" don takaita jerin.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Wani ƙaramin maɓalli a kusurwar kowane shafi, a kan kowane jigo, ba tare da wani saiti ba.','Off'=>'Kashe','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Kusurwar ƙasa, gefen ƙarshe','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Kusurwar ƙasa, gefen farawa','Top corner, end side'=>'Kusurwar sama, gefen ƙarshe','Top corner, start side'=>'Kusurwar sama, gefen farawa','Switcher around the content'=>'Mai sauyawa a kewayen abun ciki','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ƙara mai sauyawa zuwa kowane rubutu da shafi','Before the content'=>'Kafin abun ciki','After the content'=>'Bayan abun ciki','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Wasu hanyoyin ƙara canji','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Editan bulogi da editan shafi: bulogin "Sauya harshe", tare da zane-zane guda biyar.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: sinadarin "Sauya harshe".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Kundayen menu: Bayyanarwa → Kundayen menu → akwatin “Canja harshe”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Kandunan gefe: widget ɗin "Mai canza harshe".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'A wani wuri daban, gajeren lambar:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor da Bricks: widget na "Sauya yare" a kowane magini.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Widget na Elementor da Bricks suna cikin Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Ajiye','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Babban fayil ga kowane yare: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Wani yanki na ƙasa na kowane yare: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Wani yanki na daban ga kowane harshe: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Siffar tambaya: example.com/?lang=de (tsofaffin shafuka)','Category'=>'Rukuni','Tag'=>'Tag','Product'=>'Samfuri','Product category'=>'Rukunin samfur','Product tag'=>'Alamar samfur','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'An ajiye. Adiresoshin yarenku sun canza kamar yadda aka nuna a ƙasa.','Language in the address'=>'Harshe a adireshin','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Yadda maziyarta da injunan bincike suke isa kowane harshe','Address word for %s'=>'Kalmar gaisuwa ga %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Tsohuwar yaren ba ta da kalma a cikin adiresoshinta.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Yankin yanki na %s (na zaɓi)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Fara nuna yankin zuwa wannan rukunin yanar gizon. Harshen da ba shi da yanki yana amfani da babban fayil akan babban yankinku.','Where each language lives now'=>'Inda kowane yare yake a yanzu','Translated address words'=>'Kalmomin adireshin da aka fassara','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Adiresoshin shafi da na maƙala suna fitowa ne daga fassararrun kanun labaransu. A nan za ku fassara kafaffun kalmomin, don haka /de/kategorie/ yana maye gurbin /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (yanzu “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Injin bincike da maziyarta','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Ba maziyarta damar zabar yarensu ta hanyar karamin fanni (ba tare da tura su wani shafi ba)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ɓoye shafukan da ba a fassara ba daga injunan bincike (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Fassarar da har yanzu ke ɗauke da ainihin rubutun ana cire ta daga sakamakon bincike har sai an fassara ta.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Wani ɓangare na Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly yana ƙara hanyoyin haɗin hreflang (tare da x-default), yaren shafi da alkibla, da kowane yare zuwa taswirar rukunin yanar gizon ku:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Aiki tare da: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Kowace kalmar adireshi tana ƙunshe da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi ko dashes guda 2 zuwa 12.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Fassarar kai tsaye yayin sabuntawa, matsayin masu bita, fitar da XLIFF don masu fassara, sauyawa daga WPML, Polylang ko TranslatePress da duba inganci ta AI na zuwa tare da Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Lokacin da asali ya canza','When a page is edited'=>'Lokacin da aka gyara shafi','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Alamta fassarorinsa a matsayin wadanda suka wuce lokaci','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Sake fassara fassarorinsa a bango','Do nothing'=>'Kada ka yi komai','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Fassarar da wani ya gyara ba a taba share ta a rubuta wata a kai ba; a maimakon haka ana nuna ta a matsayin wadda ta wuce lokaci.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Fassara sabbin shafuka zuwa kowane harshe idan an buga su','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Wani samfurin AI na biyu yana karanta kowace fassara tare da asalinta, yana ba ta maki kuma yana nuna kuskuren da ke ciki. Yana amfani da naka mabuɗin AI daga saitunan AI. Fara bincike daga Matsayin fassara.','AI provider'=>'Mai ba da AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Babban samfurin saitunan AI','Recommended'=>'Wanda aka ba da shawara','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Shafi yana buƙatar duba na ɗan adam ƙasa da wannan maki','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Buga fassarorin da mai bita ya amince da su kawai','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Ba wa mutane matsayin Mai Fassara (yana gyara fassarori, ba ainihin rubutu ba, ba zai iya bugawa ba) ko matsayin Mai Bitar Fassara (yana kuma amincewa). Masu bita kuma suna samun duk abin da ke jira a cikin jerin Rubuce-rubuce da Shafuka a ƙarƙashin "Pending"; buga ɗaya a can yana nuna amincewa da shi.','Manage users'=>'Sarrafa masu amfani','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Babu abin da ke jiran dubawa.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Bayanin kula ga mai fassara (na zaɓi)','Read side by side'=>'Karanta gefe da gefe','Approve'=>'Amince','Ask for changes'=>'Nemi canje-canje','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'An shigo da fassarori guda %d kuma an kare su daga fassarar na\'ura.','Export and import for translators'=>'Fitarwa da shigarwa don masu fassara','Not translated yet'=>'Ba a fassara ba tukuna','Already translated'=>'An riga an fassara','Format'=>'Tsari','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (kayan aikin fassara)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (shafukan rubutu)','Download the file'=>'Sauke fayil ɗin','Import a translated file'=>'Shigar da fayil ɗin da aka fassara','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'An soke: an cire hanyoyin haɗi %1$d, an goge shafukan da aka shigo da su %2$d.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Gwajin aiki, babu abin da aka canza:','Imported:'=>'An shigo da:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'Harsuna %1$d an ƙara, fassarori %2$d an haɗa, shafuka %3$d an gina, rubutu %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Kashe sauran plugin ɗin da farko (adireshinta da masu sauyawa za su yi rikici da Tranzly). Bayananta na nan a inda suke, don haka za ku iya komawa baya; Soke aikin zai cire ainihin abin da shigo da bayanan ya ƙara.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Babu bayanai daga wannan manhaja a wannan shafin.','Languages: %s'=>'Harsuna: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'har yanzu yana aiki: kashe shi tukuna.','Dry run'=>'Gwajin aiki','Import'=>'Shigo da','Undo the import'=>'Soke shigo da shi','Comments and product reviews'=>'Sharhi da bitar samfurori','Each language keeps its own'=>'Kowane harshe yana riƙe da nasa','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Nuna sharuddan kowane harshe a kowane juzu\'i','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Nuna su duka, a fassara zuwa yaren mai karatu','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Fassarar tana amfani da injin fassararka ga kowane sharhin da aka amince da shi. Ba a taɓa aika saƙonnin banza (spam) da sharhohin da ke jiran a duba su ba.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'An ajiye. Sassan da kuka canza an yi musu alama a matsayin wanda mutum ya duba, kuma an kare wannan fassarar daga fassarar na\'ura.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'An canza fasalin wannan fassarar a cikin edita, don haka wasu ɓangarori ba sa dacewa da na asali. Ana nuna ɓangarorin da ba su da abokin tarayya a fanko; gyara sauran a cikin edita.','Open the editor'=>'Bude edita','Original (%s)'=>'Na asali (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Fassara (%s)','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Open in the editor'=>'Bude a cikin edita','Checked by a person'=>'Mutum ya duba','Imported'=>'An shigo da shi','Not in the translation'=>'Ba ya cikin fassarar','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ƙara yare na biyu a ƙarƙashin Tranzly a cikin menu na gudanarwa, kuma mai canzawa zai bayyana a nan.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe a tsoho: tuta tana nufin ƙasa ne, ba yare ba.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Abin da masu karanta allo ke sanarwa, misali “Zaɓi yare”.','Colours'=>'Launuka','Not translated'=>'Ba a fassara ba','Original'=>'Na asali','Published'=>'An buga','Draft'=>'Tsari','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Mutum ya duba, an kiyaye','Imported, protected'=>'An shigo da shi, mai kariya','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Ba a fassara ba tukuna (kwafi)','View'=>'Duba','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Bude don a sake fassara shi','Protect'=>'Kare','Publish the translations'=>'Buga fassarorin','Translate into %d language'=>'Fassara zuwa harshe %d' . "\0" . 'Fassara zuwa yaruka %d','Show this block'=>'Nuna wannan kankara','In every language'=>'A kowane harshe','Only in the languages ticked'=>'A cikin yarukan da aka yi wa alama kawai','In every language except those ticked'=>'A kowane harshe banda waɗanda aka zaɓa','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'An ba da izinin wakilan AI. Sake loda wannan shafi don ganin kayan aikin.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'An kashe wakilan AI. Adireshin haɗin su ba ya amsawa kuma.','Image per language'=>'Hoto a kowane harshe','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Nuna wani hoton ga masu karatu na wani yare, misali tuta mai ɗauke da kalmomi.','Replace the %s image'=>'Sauya hoton %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Zaɓi hoton %s','Use the original image'=>'Yi amfani da ainihin hoton','Engine for %s'=>'Injin don %s','The default engine'=>'Injini ta asali','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Idan inji ya gaza ko ya kai iyaka, gwada waɗannan na gaba, a cikin wannan jeri','Monthly spending caps'=>'Iyakokin kashe kuɗi na kowane wata','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Idan inji ya kai ƙarshen iyakarsa, ba za a sake aika masa da wani abu ba har sai wata mai zuwa kuma rahoton fassarar da ta gaza zai bayyana dalili. Bar shi babu komai idan babu iyaka.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (abinda aka kashe a wannan watan: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Ajiye iyakoki','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Fassarorin da aka fi so (ɗaya a kowane layi: kalma = fassara)','Formality'=>'Yanayin bin ka\'ida','Default'=>'Na asali','Formal'=>'A hukumance','Informal'=>'Ba na ƙa\'ida ba','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Umarnin salo (masu kallo, muryar alama)','Correct this translation'=>'Gyara wannan fassarar','Saving…'=>'Ana ajiyewa…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Fassarashen rubutu. Latsa Enter don gyara shi.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Danna kowane rubutu mai layi don gyara fassararsa.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Ba a sami rubutun da aka fassara a wannan shafin don gyarawa a nan ba. Yi amfani da editan gefe-da-gefe a maimakon haka.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Mai canza harshe','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Hanyoyin haɗi zuwa wannan shafi a kowane ɗayan yarukan rukunin yanar gizon. Ba ya nuna komai har sai an lissafa yaruka biyu ko fiye.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Harshe','block keywordswitcher'=>'Mai sauyawa','block keywordtranslation'=>'Fassara','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Yana barin baƙi su karanta wannan shafi a wani yaren naku: jeri, kwayoyi, maballai, jerin zaɓuka ko lambobin yare, tare da tutoci na zaɓi.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'Mai yaruka da yawa']];